<issue_title>upstream(agents): 移植 5 个冲突 commit (P0,P1) — v2026.2.19→v2026.2.21</issue_title>
<issue_description>## 任务

将以下 5 个上游 commit 的修改语义化应用到本 fork。这些 commit 无法直接 cherry-pick（存在冲突），需要理解修改意图后手动应用等效变更。

### 上游版本范围
- **来源**: openclaw/openclaw v2026.2.19 → v2026.2.21
- **模块**: `agents`
- **优先级**: P0,P1

### 需要移植的 commit

#### Commit 1: `c8466e516f32` (P1)
**描述**: fix(agents): raise dynamic retry cap budget
**涉及文件**: `CHANGELOG.md,src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.overflow-compaction.test.ts,src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.ts`



#### Commit 2: `b25d3652e78d` (P1)
**描述**: fix(agents): cap embedded runner retry loop
**涉及文件**: `CHANGELOG.md,src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.overflow-compaction.test.ts,src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/run.ts,src/agents/pi-embedded-runner/types.ts`

